  "details": "Recently I've been hopping from instance to instance of a Karaoke World in the hopes of finding one with good vibes. But, I often accidently rejoin instances I've previously been to because they've shifted position in the instance list since I last joined them.\n\nI think a feature that timestamps when/if you joined a specific instance could be handy - so it'd say something like \"joined 3 mins ago\" when hovering over an instance, so you don't accidentally join one you've just been in while instance hopping.",
